{"effective_mode":"full","effective_text_preview_length":200,"nodes":[{"end_index":9603,"paragraph_id":"65853170","paragraph_index":151,"start_index":9603,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9674,"paragraph_id":"41C68C39","paragraph_index":152,"start_index":9604,"text_preview":"如果有多个必需结果项，应保留各项的达成、未达成或待确认状态，再依据事先确定的聚合规则给出总体结论。不能仅因为其中一项成功就宣布整个任","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9684,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"78FE4E2E","paragraph_index":153,"start_index":9675,"text_preview":"与后续坚守分开结算","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":9758,"paragraph_id":"4F0A34FE","paragraph_index":154,"start_index":9685,"text_preview":"若某次行动结束后需要持续保持状态，行动任务与坚守任务应分别判定：前者确认指定结果是否形成，后者检查之后的保持时段。前者成功，不会自动","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9806,"paragraph_id":"559FDEE5","paragraph_index":155,"start_index":9759,"text_preview":"判定说明：这里定义的是通用的执行与结果确认口径，不引入打击效能计算、目标优先级或武器分配规则。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9808,"paragraph_id":"7136E33C","paragraph_index":156,"start_index":9807,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9815,"heading_level":1,"paragraph_id":"61B87226","paragraph_index":157,"start_index":9809,"text_preview":"五 要点坚守","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":9825,"paragraph_id":"7C0017A8","paragraph_index":158,"start_index":9816,"text_preview":"任务代号：hold","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9857,"paragraph_id":"2A9891E7","paragraph_index":159,"start_index":9826,"text_preview":"基本含义：在规定时间内，持续保持指定要点的有效守护或控制状态。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9901,"paragraph_id":"3A2206C9","paragraph_index":160,"start_index":9858,"text_preview":"重点理解：“现在有人在”只是当前状态；“这段时间一直满足要求”才是持续坚守要证明的事。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":9913,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"466B2BE1","paragraph_index":161,"start_index":9902,"text_preview":"先选择在位还是状态判据","type":"Heading"},{"col_count":3,"end_index":10024,"first_row_texts":["判据类型","怎样理解","适用前提"],"paragraph_index":162,"row_count":3,"start_index":9914,"table_end":10024,"table_id":"ggce0z9w","table_index":18,"table_rows":[{"cells":[{"col":1,"end_index":9919,"row":1,"start_index":9915,"text_preview":"判据类型"},{"col":2,"end_index":9925,"row":1,"start_index":9921,"text_preview":"怎样理解"},{"col":3,"end_index":9931,"row":1,"start_index":9927,"text_preview":"适用前提"}],"row":1},{"cells":[{"col":1,"end_index":9938,"row":2,"start_index":9934,"text_preview":"有效在位"},{"col":2,"end_index":9960,"row":2,"start_index":9940,"text_preview":"在约定范围内的有效参"},{"col":3,"end_index":9977,"row":2,"start_index":9962,"text_preview":"能够判断位置、可用性"}],"row":2},{"cells":[{"col":1,"end_index":9984,"row":3,"start_index":9980,"text_preview":"守护状态"},{"col":2,"end_index":10002,"row":3,"start_index":9986,"text_preview":"守护或覆盖状态始终不"},{"col":3,"end_index":10021,"row":3,"start_index":10004,"text_preview":"状态有明确定义、变化"}],"row":3}],"table_start":9914,"type":"Table"},{"end_index":10025,"paragraph_id":"44574CC9","paragraph_index":163,"start_index":10025,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10099,"paragraph_id":"64299E39","paragraph_index":164,"start_index":10026,"text_preview":"这两种判据可以选择其一，也可以明确要求同时满足，但不能未经说明就互相替代。持续覆盖论文里的数值状态，是一个数学模型；不能自动把它当成","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10108,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"2BA7DD6E","paragraph_index":165,"start_index":10100,"text_preview":"轮换需要表达什么","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":10193,"paragraph_id":"61E68DF0","paragraph_index":166,"start_index":10109,"text_preview":"同时在位数量与总参与数量不同。轮换要记录谁离开、谁接替、有效在位状态何时变化。参与者可以更换，只要选定的任务条件始终满足；也不能仅凭","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10194,"paragraph_id":"64E02D3E","paragraph_index":167,"start_index":10194,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10196,"paragraph_id":"0734836F","paragraph_index":168,"start_index":10195,"text_preview":"[Image]","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10225,"paragraph_id":"04A2FFFC","paragraph_index":169,"start_index":10197,"text_preview":"人员可以轮换 守护条件持续满足 下方时间条示意接替无空缺","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":10233,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"7C432509","paragraph_index":170,"start_index":10226,"text_preview":"论文能提供什么","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":10328,"paragraph_id":"36F0B6D7","paragraph_index":171,"start_index":10234,"text